[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/comments/258676719","html_url":"https://github.com/typeorm/typeorm/issues/78#issuecomment-258676719","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/78","id":258676719,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI1ODY3NjcxOQ==","user":{"login":"pleerock","id":1753397,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTMzOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1753397?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock","html_url":"https://github.com/pleerock","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-11-06T12:07:03Z","updated_at":"2016-11-06T12:07:03Z","body":"checkout [this page](https://typeorm.github.io/tables-and-columns.html). But I don't recommend to use class table inheritance because its too complex, have a small value and implementation may have bugs. Alternatively I suggest to simple use abstract tables, inherit them and thats all\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/comments/258676719/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"pleerock","id":1753397,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTMzOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1753397?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock","html_url":"https://github.com/pleerock","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/comments/258682187","html_url":"https://github.com/typeorm/typeorm/issues/78#issuecomment-258682187","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/78","id":258682187,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI1ODY4MjE4Nw==","user":{"login":"AmirTugi","id":8065975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNjU5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8065975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmirTugi","html_url":"https://github.com/AmirTugi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmirTugi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmirTugi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmirTugi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmirTugi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmirTugi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmirTugi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmirTugi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmirTugi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmirTugi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-11-06T13:51:45Z","updated_at":"2016-11-06T13:51:45Z","body":"That's what I did at the beginning, but then I encountered a problem when having a ManyToOne relation and having to point to an abstract table (see below figure)\n\n![2016-11-06 1](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/8065975/20038177/ad67b256-a437-11e6-8b19-9f8de17d9a94.png)\n\nI get this error:\n\n```\nError: Entity metadata for DocumentLine#document was not found.\n    at entityMetadata.relations.forEach.relation (D:\\Projects\\ArihavAPI\\node_modules\\typeorm\\metadata-builder\\EntityMetadataBuilder.js:269:27)\n    at PropertyMetadataArgsCollection.forEach (native)\n    at entityMetadatas.forEach.entityMetadata (D:\\Projects\\ArihavAPI\\node_modules\\typeorm\\metadata-builder\\EntityMetadataBuilder.js:266:38)\n    at Array.forEach (native)\n    at EntityMetadataBuilder.build (D:\\Projects\\ArihavAPI\\node_modules\\typeorm\\metadata-builder\\EntityMetadataBuilder.js:265:25)\n    at EntityMetadataBuilder.buildFromMetadataArgsStorage (D:\\Projects\\ArihavAPI\\node_modules\\typeorm\\metadata-builder\\EntityMetadataBuilder.js:149:21)\n    at Connection.buildMetadatas (D:\\Projects\\ArihavAPI\\node_modules\\typeorm\\connection\\Connection.js:323:18)\n    at Connection.<anonymous> (D:\\Projects\\ArihavAPI\\node_modules\\typeorm\\connection\\Connection.js:113:18)\n    at next (native)\n    at fulfilled (D:\\Projects\\ArihavAPI\\node_modules\\typeorm\\connection\\Connection.js:4:58)\n```\n\nBecause `Document` is abstract. I do, however, want to keep the `documentLines` relation in `Document`, and so it will be general for any child of it.\n\nThese are the models:\n\n```\n@AbstractTable()\nexport class Document {\n    @PrimaryGeneratedColumn()\n    id: number;\n    @OneToMany(type => DocumentLine, documentLine => documentLine.document)\n    documentLines: DocumentLine[];\n    @Column()\n    dollarRate: number = 0;\n    @Column()\n    orderBy: string = '';\n    @Column()\n    comments: string = '';\n    @Column()\n    subTotal: number = 0;\n    @Column()\n    vat: number = 0;\n    @Column()\n    total: number = 0;\n    @Column()\n    createdBy: string = '';\n    @CreateDateColumn()\n    createdAt: string;\n    @UpdateDateColumn()\n    updatedAt: string;\n}\n```\n\n```\n@Table()\nexport class DeliveryNote extends Document {\n\n    @PrimaryGeneratedColumn()\n    id: number;\n\n    @ManyToOne(type => Customer, customer => customer.deliveryNotes)\n    customer: Customer;\n\n    @Column()\n    invoice: string = '';\n}\n```\n\n```\n@Table()\nexport class DocumentLine {\n    @PrimaryGeneratedColumn()\n    id: number;\n    @ManyToOne(type => Item, item => item.documentLines)\n    item: Item;\n    @Column()\n    itemPartNumber: string = this.item.partNumber;\n    @Column()\n    itemDescription: string = this.item.description;\n    @ManyToOne(type => Document, document => document.documentLines)\n    document: Document;\n    @Column()\n    comments: string = '';\n    @Column()\n    quantity: number = 0;\n    @Column()\n    price: number = 0;\n    @Column()\n    total: number = 0;\n    @CreateDateColumn()\n    createdAt: string;\n    @UpdateDateColumn()\n    updatedAt: string;\n}\n```\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/comments/258682187/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"AmirTugi","id":8065975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNjU5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8065975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmirTugi","html_url":"https://github.com/AmirTugi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmirTugi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmirTugi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmirTugi/gists{